# Monstrous Emergence's ruling (2024-09-20): "If that creature is no longer on the battlefield when Monstrous Emergence resolves, use that creature's power as it last
# existed on the battlefield" (CR 608.2h). Bot1 chooses its Elvish Mystic (1/1), and Bot2 kills it in response with a Lightning Bolt. The spell still resolves and deals 1
# damage, the Mystic's last-known power, to Bot2's Grizzly Bears (2/2), which survives.

